ny_minus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.YangMillsVacuumFlat.HodgePairing.bogomolny_minus","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/YangMillsVacuumFlat.lean#L148-L151","doc":"**Bogomolny, `rem:instanton-on-shell`.** `S(F) = c₂(F) + 2‖F⁻‖²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.YangMillsVacuumFlat.HodgePairing.charge_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.YangMillsVacuumFlat.HodgePairing.charge_eq","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/YangMillsVacuumFlat.lean#L139-L146","doc":"`c₂(F) = ‖F⁺‖² − ‖F⁻‖²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.YangMillsVacuumFlat.HodgePairing.action_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.YangMillsVacuumFlat.HodgePairing.action_eq","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/YangMillsVacuumFlat.lean#L131-L137","doc":"`S(F) = ‖F⁺‖² + ‖F⁻‖²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.YangMillsVacuumFlat.HodgePairing.B_minus_plus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.YangMillsVacuumFlat.HodgePairing.B_minus_plus","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/YangMillsVacuumFlat.lean#L128-L129","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.YangMillsVacuumFlat.HodgePairing.B_plus_minus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.YangMillsVacuumFlat.HodgePairing.B_plus_minus","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/YangMillsVacuumFlat.lean#L120-L126","doc":"`F⁺ ⊥ F⁻`. ","signatureC